meta {
  name: HospitalApi - Auth - Signin (Patient)
}

env {
  baseUrl = "http://localhost:3000"
}

### Sign In Patient
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test.patient@example.com",
  "password": "password1"
}

# After sign in, capture `data.accessToken` and use it for protected routes.
